  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed in painting (walls, furniture, art) and finishing work. The three stages of painting are typically {下塗|したぬ}り (undercoat), {中塗|なかぬ}り (middle coat), and {上塗|うわぬ}り (top coat).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {下塗|したぬ}りをする (to apply an undercoat)\n- {下塗|したぬ}り{材|ざい} (primer material)\n- {下塗|したぬ}り{剤|ざい} (primer agent)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {上塗|うわぬ}り: top coat, finish coat — the final layer\n- プライマー: primer (loanword) — same meaning in technical contexts",
